Introducing the Lord Desk Kit: the perfect addition to any workspace! This Desk Kit includes a leather coaster, a leather cable clip, a leather pen sleeve, and a leather desk mat. Made from high-quality Pull-up Latigo leather in a beautiful light brown color, our Desk Kit is both stylish and functional.

The leather coaster will protect your desk from scratches and watermarks, while the leather cable clip will keep your cables organized and tangle-free. The leather pen sleeve will keep your favorite pen safe and secure, and the leather desk mat will add a touch of elegance to your workspace.

Our Desk Kit is available on demand, and comes with off-white thread. Don't miss out on this opportunity to elevate your workspace with our Desk Kit - order yours today!

